{"ref":"BDB, רִֽצְפָה","hw":"רִֽצְפָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רִֽצְפָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. pavement</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.17\">Ez 40:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִֽצְפַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a> (van d. H. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִצְפָּה</span>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">פַּת</span>);—<em>pavement</em>, in Ezek.’s temple, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.17\">Ez 40:17</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 40:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.40.18\">18</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 42:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.42.3\">42:3</a>; Sol.’s temple <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 7:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.7.3\">2 Ch 7:3</a>; in a palace <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>.","next":"BDB, מַרְצֶ֫פֶת²","prev":"BDB, רָצַף"}